{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Effects are tagged per level in classes.json (levels[].effects); this file holds the taxonomy, condition labels, and open questions.",
    "Values are the signed number in the stat's unit. pct = percentage points (+50% -> 50); flat = absolute amount (HP, Coins, multiplier); flag = on/off, value omitted.",
    "Discounts are positive '_discount' stats: '-50% off' -> 50. Higher is better.",
    "Chances, thresholds, and crit chances are pct stats so additive sources sum (e.g. Jack-o'-Lantern L1 20 + L4 10).",
    "Non-numeric unlocks (recipes, auto-actions, immunities) are flag stats with no value.",
    "'when' marks any condition or per-unit scaling (as_driver, in_darkness, per_10_kills, per_consecutive_hit, ...). Only effects with the same stat AND same 'when' (or both without) may be summed.",
    "'X & Y' text is split into one effect per stat with the same value.",
    "Uncertain effects carry 'uncertain': '<questionId>' (key into 'questions'); they render in a separate 'Uncertain' group and are excluded from totals.",
    "Totals must flag any stat whose contributions include more than one source from the same class (see question class-duplicates).",
    "'Crit Chance is X%' is additive to crit chance (+X).",
    "Bounties convert to Coins but can only be sold at random Markets (not every fortress); filed under Convert. market_sell_rate: random Markets have a sell table like the fortress with a variable multiplier (0.5x-2x, changes every 5 min, 1x = fortress price); +1x raises the minimum to 1.5x.",
    "Engineer L5 Flamethrowers & Frosthrowers are turrets; normal turret and crafting rules apply.",
    "Blessed (Priest L2/L3): the Priest blesses one person at a time with the staff equipped; lasts about 1 minute (when: blessed_by_staff, scope team).",
    "scope is who benefits: self, nearby (nearby teammates), team (whole team; all L4 TEAM levels). Enemy debuffs/auras the player emits are scope self.",
    "hp_regen is normalized to % of Max HP per second.",
    "Assumption: Recruit L5 '+25% stronger passives' is a multiplier applying to both pct and flat values of rolled passives; results round to 1 decimal (method still open: question recruit-rounding).",
    "Assumption: Crafter L2 Drill Boosts: boost distance +50% is a fact (50km -> 75km); boost amount +50% (200% -> 300%) is assumed.",
    "Assumption: Engineer L2 turret discount stacks additively with Crafting Shack discounts (Crafter L1/L4) on turrets.",
    "Assumption: Scope rule: L4 effects are scope team. Where a level gives a bigger bonus to nearby teammates, a separate nearby effect is kept alongside the team one so the UI can call out the higher bonus for close players."
  ],
